</head><body class="ew-body"><div class="ew-app" data-page="detail">

<main class="ew-container ew-detail-container"><a class="ew-return" href="/environmental-watch/#ew-live-map">← Back to Environmental Watch</a>
<div id="ew-detail-loading" class="ew-feed-status" role="status">Loading event data from official source…</div>
<div id="ew-detail-main" hidden>
<div class="ew-detail-hero"><div><div class="ew-detail-headline"><span id="ew-detail-category" class="ew-eyebrow">NATURAL EVENT</span><span id="ew-detail-status" class="ew-event-status">—</span></div><h1 id="ew-detail-title">Event Details</h1><p id="ew-detail-subtitle">Loading…</p><span class="ew-detail-meta">Source observation: <b id="ew-detail-reported">—</b></span></div></div>
<div class="ew-demo-banner" id="ew-detail-demo" hidden>DEMO MODE — This is a fictitious event created for interface testing, not a current incident.</div>
<nav class="ew-detail-tabs" aria-label="Event sections"><a class="ew-tab is-selected" href="#overview">Overview</a><a class="ew-tab" href="#location">Map &amp; Location</a><a class="ew-tab" href="#impacts">Ecological Context</a><a class="ew-tab" href="#sources">Sources</a></nav>
<section class="ew-panel" id="overview"><div class="ew-panel-bar"><h2>Key Information</h2><span class="ew-caption">Official source values where available</span></div>
<div class="ew-detail-stats"><div><small>Location / Region</small><strong id="ew-detail-location">—</strong></div><div><small>Event type</small><strong id="ew-detail-type">—</strong></div><div><small>Data provider</small><strong id="ew-detail-provider">—</strong></div><div><small>Source record ID</small><strong id="ew-detail-id">—</strong></div></div>
<div class="ew-subpanel"><h3>Event summary</h3><p id="ew-detail-desc">—</p><p class="ew-muted" id="ew-detail-record">—</p></div></section>
<section class="ew-panel" id="location"><div class="ew-panel-bar"><h2>Location &amp; Geographic Context</h2><span class="ew-caption" id="ew-detail-coords">—</span></div>
<div class="ew-detail-map-shell"><div id="ew-detail-map" class="ew-detail-map"></div><div class="ew-map-help" id="ew-detail-map-warning" hidden>Map tiles unavailable. Original source links below remain accessible.</div></div>
<p class="ew-footnote">The marker represents the reported coordinate / approximate geographic center of the source event. It is <b>not</b> a wildfire perimeter, inundation boundary, damage area or risk forecast. This event map does not display active fire perimeters or satellite imagery overlays.</p></section>
<section class="ew-panel" id="impacts"><div class="ew-panel-bar"><h2>Potential Ecological Impacts</h2><span class="ew-caption">General context, not confirmed damage</span></div><div class="ew-impact-tiles"><div class="ew-impact-icon">❧</div><div><h3>Environmental considerations</h3><ul id="ew-impact-list"></ul></div></div><p class="ew-footnote">These are general mechanisms relevant to this event category, not measured impacts specific to this incident. Additional GIS analysis would be required to verify effects.</p></section>
<section class="ew-panel" id="sources"><div class="ew-panel-bar"><h2>Data Sources &amp; Original Records</h2><span class="ew-caption">Traceable public data</span></div>
<div class="ew-source-detail"><strong>Official event record</strong><a id="ew-detail-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open source ↗</a></div>
<p class="ew-footnote">Event records are retrieved on demand. Data may change, be corrected or become unavailable. For emergency safety instructions, consult the responsible local authority; this research portfolio is not an alert service.</p><a class="ew-primary-link" id="ew-detail-link2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original record ↗</a></section>
</div></main><footer class="ew-footer">© SpatialGround · Environmental Watch <span>Independent environmental monitoring · Not an emergency alert service</span></footer>
